  "note": "Staged as a partial and now finished. Enjoying the Ride supplies 3 timings (Morning Dew, Dark Star, Brokedown Palace) and gd72-09-16.sbd.cotsman.9247.sbeok.shnf 21. The 25th is the Not Fade Away reprise, and it needed a third source: the sandwich runs Not Fade Away > Goin' Down the Road Feeling Bad > Not Fade Away, but four of the five circulating transfers index only the first Not Fade Away and end the show at One More Saturday Night. Only gd1972-09-16.matrix.sb20.chappell.77442.flac16 breaks the reprise out, at 3:02 — so the skeleton's extra track was right and the fullest soundboard was the incomplete one.",
